{"id":"653675","name":"鸡腿拌贡菜","author":"蓝雨阳光780913","authorId":"11379263","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/653675/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡腿","amount":"1个"},{"name":"贡菜","amount":"200g"}],"sub":[{"name":"姬菇","amount":"50g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"清水里放入葱段和姜片。","img":"images/653675/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡腿洗净剖开，便于入味。","img":"images/653675/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"鸡腿放入水中煮30分钟。","img":"images/653675/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"贡菜洗净。","img":"images/653675/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入锅中汆烫一下。","img":"images/653675/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"捞出沥水。","img":"images/653675/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"鸡腿煮熟后捞出撕成小块。","img":"images/653675/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"煮熟的姬菇，鸡腿肉和贡菜放在一个大盆中。","img":"images/653675/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"各种调料放入一个碗中调拌均匀。","img":"images/653675/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"倒入大盆中。","img":"images/653675/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"抓拌均匀。","img":"images/653675/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/653675/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"脆嫩的凉拌鸡腿肉好啦！","img":"images/653675/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}